import QtQuick

// What the Details dialog says about each built-in block: a title for wire
// names that don't read as English, and a sentence or two on what it does.
// Keyed by instruction type or operator. Built per call, so a language
// switch shows up straight away.
QtObject {
    function explainer(type) {
